    "enUS": {
      "description": "Now that you've learned some moves, it's time to get you a decent weapon.  Speak with Tormus Deepforge.  He can make you a weapon I'm sure you'll like.\n\nYou'll find Tormus here in Ironforge, at the Great Forge.",
